                                    <h1>Jewelry Shopify Store — Specialist Template + Apps Stack (2026) | ITD GrowthLabs</h1>
                                    <div style="background:#fff7ed;border-left:4px solid #ff5722;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:10px;margin:24px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#334155;"><strong style="color:#ea580c;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.4px;">ITD JEWELRY PORTFOLIO &mdash; THE EVIDENCE:</strong><br>This article is written from live jewelry vertical work. ITD GrowthLabs is a specialist <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-jewelry-brands.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">digital marketing agency for jewelry brands</a> with a delivered <a href="/resources/Fabelia_Jewelry_D2C_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Fabelia jewelry D2C case study</a>, 8+ published jewelry playbooks including <a href="/resources/Gold_vs_Diamond_Jewelry_D2C_Strategy_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Gold vs Diamond D2C Strategy</a>, <a href="/resources/Jewelry_D2C_Digital_Transformation_India_Dubai_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Jewelry D2C Digital Transformation India + Dubai</a>, <a href="/resources/Best_D2C_Jewellery_Brands_UAE_GCC_2026_2027.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Best D2C Jewellery Brands UAE + GCC</a>, and city-specific jewelry marketing pages across <a href="/services/gcc/dubai-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Dubai</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/abu-dhabi-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Abu Dhabi</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/jeddah-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Jeddah</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/doha-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Doha</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/dammam-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Dammam</a>, and <a href="/services/gcc/al-khobar-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Al Khobar</a>. Every framework below is grounded in live category work &mdash; not generic D2C theory.</div><p>A jewelry Shopify store is not the same as a beauty or fashion Shopify store. The buyer converts on visual detail + certification + trust + service &mdash; not on discount + urgency. That means the theme, the apps, the checkout, and the customer journey have to be tuned for a fundamentally different funnel.</p><p>This is the specialist Shopify build we ship for D2C jewelry clients &mdash; every theme choice, app pick, and customisation, with cost + timeline reality.</p>
                                    <h2>Theme choice &amp;mdash; free vs premium vs custom for jewelry</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Dawn (Shopify's free theme):</strong> Fast, clean, well-maintained. Works for fashion + lab-grown D2C with lighter product catalogue (30-80 SKUs). Requires custom sections for 360&deg;, AR, wishlist, video consultation. Setup cost Rs 40K-Rs 1.2 lakh with sections + customisation.</p><p><strong>Premium themes (Prestige, Impulse, Symmetry, Motion) $280-$400:</strong> Good starting point for fine + fashion mid-catalogue (50-200 SKUs). Better lookbook + collection page templates. Still needs jewelry-specific sections (certification display, video consultation, wishlist retargeting). Total build Rs 1.5-3 lakh.</p><p><strong>Custom Shopify theme:</strong> Warranted for fine + bridal + luxury brands with 100+ SKU catalogue + strong brand-identity needs. Full control over sensory storytelling + high-value UX. Cost Rs 3-8 lakh. 8-12 weeks build.</p><p><strong>Headless Shopify (Hydrogen + Next.js):</strong> For enterprise D2C at Rs 3 Cr+ / month revenue with performance-critical needs + multi-region tenancy. Rs 8-15 lakh build + Rs 2-4L / year Vercel or hosting. Overkill for launch, right for scale-up.</p><p>Recommendation for most launches: premium theme (Prestige is the jewelry favourite) + jewelry-specific customisations. Custom only if brand + catalogue justify.</p>
                                    <h2>Product-page must-haves &amp;mdash; the 9-element checklist</h2>
                                    <p>Every jewelry SKU page must include the following elements for buyer confidence + conversion:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>360&deg; product spin</strong> (WebRotate 360, Spinifex, native carousel with 24-32 frames).</li><li><strong>15-30 second video</strong> (multi-angle + on-model + lifestyle context).</li><li><strong>AR try-on</strong> for rings + earrings + necklaces (MirrAR, Jewelfie, Perfect Corp).</li><li><strong>Zoom / macro detail</strong> (hallmark, stone-setting, finishing).</li><li><strong>Certification display + downloadable PDF</strong> (BIS, HUID, IGI, GIA, SGL).</li><li><strong>Sizing + size-guide + at-home-sizing offer</strong>.</li><li><strong>Video consultation booking widget</strong> (Calendly or WhatsApp click-to-chat).</li><li><strong>Wishlist + save-for-later</strong> (Growave, Wishlist Plus).</li><li><strong>Shipping insurance opt-in at checkout</strong> (Route, Corso, or Shopify-native).</li></ul><p>Missing 3+ of these = 30-60% conversion penalty vs category norm.</p>
                                    <h2>The essential jewelry apps stack</h2>
                                    <p>Beyond theme, these are the apps that materially move conversion + LTV for D2C jewelry Shopify stores:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Klaviyo (email + SMS):</strong> Wishlist + browse abandonment + back-in-stock + certification-share flows. Rs 3-15K / month based on list size.</li><li><strong>Interakt or AiSensy (WhatsApp Cloud API):</strong> Booking + tracking + broadcast + video-consultation. Rs 8-25K / month.</li><li><strong>Judge.me or Yotpo Reviews:</strong> UGC photo + video reviews. Certification integration. Rs 2-15K / month.</li><li><strong>Growave or Wishlist Plus:</strong> Wishlist + save + share-with-family (bridal + gifting critical). Rs 1-8K / month.</li><li><strong>Bold Subscriptions or Recharge:</strong> For everyday-wear + accessories subscription programs. Rs 5-15K / month.</li><li><strong>Route or Corso Insurance:</strong> Shipping + package insurance at checkout. Revenue-share, no fixed fee.</li><li><strong>Loox or Trustify:</strong> Post-purchase review capture with photos. Rs 2-8K / month.</li><li><strong>Shopify Search + Discovery:</strong> Native filters + search &mdash; free but requires setup for gemstone + metal + occasion filters.</li></ul><p>Total tooling cost Rs 30-80K / month for a properly instrumented jewelry Shopify. Justified even at Rs 25L / month revenue.</p>
                                    <h2>Payment + checkout for high-value jewelry</h2>
                                    <p>Jewelry checkouts have specific requirements standard Shopify defaults miss:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Higher transaction limits:</strong> Razorpay + Cashfree + PayU standard limits Rs 1-2 lakh. For fine + bridal (Rs 3L+ AOV) enable enhanced-limit tiers via merchant application.</li><li><strong>EMI + BNPL:</strong> Zest Money + Bajaj EMI + Simpl + LazyPay integrated into checkout. 40-60% of Rs 25K+ orders opt for EMI.</li><li><strong>Cash-on-delivery for select tiers:</strong> COD works up to Rs 25-50K depending on serviceability. Above that, WhatsApp video consultation + wire transfer.</li><li><strong>UPI + wallets:</strong> UPI dominant for Rs 500-25K range. Paytm + PhonePe wallets for GCC + Indian diaspora buyers.</li><li><strong>International payments:</strong> Stripe + PayPal for USD + GBP. Emirates NBD Payment Gateway + Network International for AED + SAR.</li><li><strong>Insurance at checkout:</strong> 30-50% opt-in rate on Rs 25K+ orders when insurance is prominently offered.</li></ul>
                                    <h2>Build timeline + total cost</h2>
                                    <p>Realistic jewelry Shopify build (theme + apps + customisation + content + testing + launch):</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Boutique / fashion (Starter):</strong> Rs 2-4 lakh + 4-6 weeks. Dawn or premium theme + core apps + 30-80 SKUs migrated + basic customisation.</li><li><strong>Mid-market fine + fashion:</strong> Rs 4-8 lakh + 6-10 weeks. Premium theme + full apps stack + 100-300 SKUs + AR + video consultation + Klaviyo + WhatsApp setup.</li><li><strong>Enterprise fine + bridal + luxury:</strong> Rs 8-15 lakh + 10-16 weeks. Custom theme + advanced apps + multi-region + Arabic + Hindi + 300+ SKUs + full concierge + video consultation + insurance.</li><li><strong>Headless (Hydrogen + Next.js):</strong> Rs 12-25 lakh + 12-18 weeks. Enterprise scale only. Requires ongoing dev retainer.</li></ul><p>Content + photography + video is separate (Rs 2-8 lakh additional per <a href="/resources/jewelry_product_photography_360_ar_d2c.php">photography playbook</a>).</p>

                                    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%); padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 40px 0; text-align: center; color: #fff;">
                                        <h3 style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:15px;">Ready to Get Started?</h3>
                                        <p style="color:#ccc;margin-bottom:25px;">Book a free 30-minute jewelry D2C discovery call. We map your brand + funnel + share a customised proposal within 3 working days.</p>
                                        <a href="https://www.itdgrowthlabs.com/contact-us.php" style="background:#ff5722;color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;">Contact Us Today</a>
                                        <a href="https://calendly.com/itdgrowthlabs-info/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="js-book-call" data-source="blog_cta" style="background:#1565c0;color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;">Book Free 30-min Call</a>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Which Shopify theme is best for a jewelry D2C store?</h3>
                                        <p>Prestige is the jewelry favourite premium theme ($280) — strong collection + product page templates + easy customisation. Dawn (free) works for lighter catalogue with custom sections. Custom theme (Rs 3-8L) only if brand + 100+ SKU catalogue justify.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does a jewelry Shopify store cost to build?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 2-4 lakh for boutique / fashion (4-6 weeks). Rs 4-8 lakh mid-market fine + fashion (6-10 weeks). Rs 8-15 lakh enterprise fine + bridal (10-16 weeks). Rs 12-25L headless enterprise. Content + photography separate.</p>
                                        <h3>Do I need AR try-on for jewelry from day one?</h3>
                                        <p>For rings + earrings + necklaces, yes. AR reduces returns 25-40% + lifts conversion 15-25%. MirrAR, Jewelfie, Perfect Corp are the main options. Rs 30K-Rs 2L setup + Rs 5-15K / month app fees. Fast payback.</p>
                                        <h3>Which apps must a jewelry Shopify store have?</h3>
                                        <p>Klaviyo (email + SMS), Interakt / AiSensy (WhatsApp), Judge.me / Yotpo (reviews), Growave / Wishlist Plus (wishlist), Loox (post-purchase reviews), Route / Corso (shipping insurance), Shopify Search + Discovery (filters). Total Rs 30-80K / month tooling.</p>
                                        <h3>Can I sell Rs 5 lakh+ jewelry through Shopify checkout?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes with enhanced-limit merchant tier + EMI + wire-transfer + WhatsApp video consultation flow. Razorpay + Cashfree + PayU support after tier upgrade. 40-60% of Rs 25K+ orders opt for EMI. Above Rs 5L, wire transfer + concierge is typical.</p>
                                        <h3>Should we use Shopify or WooCommerce for a jewelry brand?</h3>
                                        <p>Shopify for 90% of jewelry D2C launches. Faster, better app ecosystem for jewelry (360, AR, wishlist), easier for internal team. WooCommerce only if content + editorial is central to brand OR you need deep custom-workflow. See our <a href="/resources/jewelry_shopify_development_agency_checklist.php">Shopify agency checklist</a>.</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD GrowthLabs build jewelry Shopify stores?</h3>
                                        <p>5 delivered logistics-adjacent SaaS builds + Fabelia jewelry case study + jewelry-vertical Shopify template stack. Discovery + theme + apps + customisation + AR + video + WhatsApp + insurance + content migration + launch + 90-day CRO iteration. See our <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-jewelry-brands.php">jewelry vertical page</a>.</p>
                                        <h3>What about international + multi-region jewelry Shopify?</h3>
                                        <p>Shopify Markets + geolocation + multi-currency (INR + AED + SAR + USD + GBP) + Arabic + Hindi content variants + region-specific payment gateways. Emirates NBD + Network International for AED + SAR. Stripe + PayPal for international. Setup adds 2-4 weeks + Rs 1-3 lakh to core build.</p>
